  "worked_solution": "Let's examine our vectors:\n\n- The vector $a=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]$ has $4$ components as it lies in ${R}^{4}.$\n\n- The vector $b=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$ has $5$ components as it lies in ${R}^{5}.$\n\nTherefore, since the number of components does not match, the operation is undefined.",
